Data availability

            All data supporting the findings of this study are openly available. The ERA5 hourly climate dataset is available at https://doi.org/10.24381/cds.adbb2d47. The Berkeley Earth global daily gridded land surface temperature dataset is available at https://berkeleyearth.org/data/. The JRA-3Q reanalysis dataset is available at https://search.diasjp.net/en/dataset/JRA3Q. Annual precipitation and potential evapotranspiration were obtained from TerraClimate and are available at https://climate.northwestknowledge.net/TERRACLIMATE/index_directDownloads.php. MODIS land cover (MCD12C1) is available at https://doi.org/10.5067/MODIS/MCD12C1.061. The Global Crop Phenology dataset (GCPE; representing mean crop phenology during 1996–2005 and referenced to the year 2000) is available at https://search.diasjp.net/en/dataset/global_crop_phenology_2000. The Group on Earth Observation Global Agriculture Monitoring (GEOGLAM) Crop Monitor crop mask is available at https://www.cropmonitor.org/baseline-data. The processed datasets supporting the main findings of this study are available via Figshare at https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.30843515 (ref. 63).
          Code availability

            The code used for heatwave detection and trend analysis is available via Figshare at https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.30843515 (ref. 63).
